  "title": "Chocolate Black Tea Cake",
  "description": "This is an Austrian recipe that was passed on from one generation to the next in my family. The secret of this cake&#39;s full flavour and softness: Prepare it one day in advance before eating it!",
  "authors": [
    "Marlies Monika"
